Subject: [RFC PATCH 00/15] ACPICA: Add CONFIG_ACPI=n build support for ACPICA header files.
Date: Wed, 18 Dec 2013 17:05:32 +0800
Message-Id: <cover.1387336613.git.lv.zheng@intel.com>
